    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "From Adam to Noah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the written account of Adam's family line.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "GEN 5:1"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 5:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "When God created mankind, he made them in the likeness of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He created them male and female and blessed them. And he named them \"Mankind\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "when they were created.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Adam had lived 130 years, he had a son in his own likeness, in his own image; and he named him Seth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After Seth was born, Adam lived 800 years and had other sons and daughters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Altogether, Adam lived a total of 930 years, and then he died.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Seth had lived 105 years, he became the father",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of Enosh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After he became the father of Enosh, Seth lived 807 years and had other sons and daughters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Altogether, Seth lived a total of 912 years, and then he died.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Enosh had lived 90 years, he became the father of Kenan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After he became the father of Kenan, Enosh lived 815 years and had other sons and daughters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Altogether, Enosh lived a total of 905 years, and then he died.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Kenan had lived 70 years, he became the father of Mahalalel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After he became the father of Mahalalel, Kenan lived 840 years and had other sons and daughters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Altogether, Kenan lived a total of 910 years, and then he died.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
