          "text": "When Mahalalel had lived 65 years, he became the father of Jared.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After he became the father of Jared, Mahalalel lived 830 years and had other sons and daughters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Altogether, Mahalalel lived a total of 895 years, and then he died.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jared had lived 162 years, he became the father of Enoch.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After he became the father of Enoch, Jared lived 800 years and had other sons and daughters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Altogether, Jared lived a total of 962 years, and then he died.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Enoch had lived 65 years, he became the father of Methuselah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After he became the father of Methuselah, Enoch walked faithfully with God 300 years and had other sons and daughters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Altogether, Enoch lived a total of 365 years.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enoch walked faithfully with God; then he was no more, because God took him away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Methuselah had lived 187 years, he became the father of Lamech.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After he became the father of Lamech, Methuselah lived 782 years and had other sons and daughters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Altogether, Methuselah lived a total of 969 years, and then he died.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Lamech had lived 182 years, he had a son.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He named him Noah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and said, \"He will comfort us in the labor and painful toil of our hands caused by the ground the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.5.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.5.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has cursed.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After Noah was born, Lamech lived 595 years and had other sons and daughters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Altogether, Lamech lived a total of 777 years, and then he died.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
